<section class="auth-card"><div class="eyebrow">SÉCURITÉ DU COMPTE</div><h1>Réinitialiser le mot de passe</h1><p class="row-meta">Saisissez le code reçu par e-mail et choisissez un nouveau mot de passe.</p><form method="post" class="form-grid"><?= client_csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="reset"><div class="field full"><label for="email">Adresse e-mail</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" required maxlength="190" autocomplete="email"></div><div class="field full"><label for="token">Code reçu</label><input id="token" name="token" required minlength="64" maxlength="64" autocomplete="one-time-code"></div><div class="field full"><label for="password">Nouveau mot de passe (10 caractères minimum)</label><input id="password" name="password" type="password" required minlength="10" autocomplete="new-password"></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn" type="submit">Mettre à jour</button></div></form></section>
